        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7_029" vertex="1" parent="p7_026" value="A consolidated project description, subsystem boundaries, document/bibliography contracts and an incremental implementation plan.&#10;Compare plain hybrid RAG against GLiNER2-enriched RAG using the same frozen corpus, questions, generator and access policy.&#10;Repository code, model cards and synthetic smoke checks do not prove technical-domain extraction or answer quality.&#10;Artifact QA checks native XML, IDs, connectors, page/text bounds and local previews; it is not a deployed service test.&#10;No services were installed, no model inference was benchmarked, and no GitHub changes were published by this delivery." style="text=1;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#20364A;lineHeight=1.25;connectable=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="18" y="60" width="1664" height="184" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
